# Breaking the Bonds of Fate (ahtUrhgan 41, COR limit break): a level 70 Corsair, level cap 70, the earlier COR quests
# completed (GMs), a Corsair's Testimony and a Bone Chip. Arrapago Reef: qm6 (no script; default
# NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY). Available: a trade to qm6: nothing; qm6 234, option 1: nothing; 234, option 0: begun.
# Accepted: qm6: YOU_MUST_BRING (the testimony); a Bone Chip: nil; the testimony: 235 ({ [7] = 1 }), option 1: nothing;
# 235, option 0: Prog 1, setPos into Talacca Cove (`tick 400`, `login`: the zone change). The battlefield: the testimony
# traded to _1l0 (requiredItems; requiredVar Prog 1; Luck of the Draw's _1l0 handler needs its Prog 4): the 32000 menu;
# option 49 (index 3 << 4 | area 1) enters; QULTADA (area 1) killed: won (allDeath), 32001 opens; finished:
# battlefieldWin 1091: the cap 70 -> 75 (YOUR_LEVEL_LIMIT_IS_NOW_75), a Scroll of Instant Warp, completed (Master of
# Chance). Arrapago: completed: no section: qm6's NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY.
lists ArrapagoReef/qm6/onTrigger ArrapagoReef/qm6/onTrade ArrapagoReef/onEventFinish/235 TalaccaCove/_1l0/onTrade TalaccaCove/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=ArrapagoReef pos=470.267,-12.292,111.817 job=COR lvl=70
levelcap 70
quest AhtUrhgan.LuckOfTheDraw completed
quest AhtUrhgan.EquippedForAllOccasions completed
quest AhtUrhgan.NavigatingTheUnfriendlySeas completed
quest AhtUrhgan.AgainstAllOdds completed
item CorsairsTestimony
item BoneChip
login
trade qm6 BoneChip x1                   # available: no trade handler: nothing
trigger qm6                             # 234
finish option=1                         # not 0: nothing
trigger qm6                             # 234
finish option=0                         # begun
trigger qm6                             # accepted: YOU_MUST_BRING (the testimony)
trade qm6 BoneChip x1                   # no testimony: nil
trade qm6 CorsairsTestimony x1          # 235 ({ [7] = 1 })
finish option=1                         # nothing
trade qm6 CorsairsTestimony x1          # 235
finish option=0                         # Prog 1; setPos into Talacca Cove
tick 400
login                                   # the zone change: Talacca Cove
warp -98.5,-9.399,-87 TalaccaCove       # beside _1l0 (and the flow checker's zone)
trade _1l0 CorsairsTestimony x1         # Prog 1: the battlefield's 32000 menu
update 32000 option=49                  # Breaking the Bonds of Fate (index 3), area 1: registered, entered
finish                                  # in the arena
kill QULTADA                            # area 1: won, battlefieldWin 1091; 32001 opens in the kill step
finish                                  # 32001: cap 70 -> 75, YOUR_LEVEL_LIMIT_IS_NOW_75; the scroll; completed: Master of Chance
warp 470.267,-12.292,111.817 ArrapagoReef
trigger qm6                             # completed: no section: NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
finish-if-event
